  \"until\": \"precombat_main\"\n\
}functions.pass_prioritycommentary\"## Card Reference\\n- (none)\\n\\n## Decision\\n\\n[Decision 1, snapshot=0] Turn 11 PRECOMBAT_MAIN - You\\n  Board: GptOSS Vet: 2hp hand=[Disciple of Perdition, Island, Island, Swamp, Thriving Isle, Unsubstantiate, Wakedancer] lib=23 bf=[Island, Island, Island, Island, Spawning Pit (charge=1), Swamp, Warden of Evos Isle 2/2] gy=[Island, Rookie Mistake, Tide Skimmer] | GPT52 Timmy: 16hp hand=3 lib=25 bf=[Ardoz 1/1 (tapped), Bolt Hound 2/2 (tapped), Irreverent Revelers 2/2 (tapped), Mountain (tapped), Mountain (tapped), Mountain (tapped), Mountain, Mountain, Spiteful Prankster 3/2 (sick), Thriving Bluff (tapped)] gy=[Chandra's Pyreling, Chandra, Flame's Fury]\\n  Message: Choose spell or ability to play:\\n  Choices (2): 1. Unsubstantiate {1}{U} (cast, {U}{U}) 2. Unsubstantiate {1}{U} (cast, {U}{U})\\n  Respond: choice=0, choice=1, etc. (not yes/no)\"assistantanalysisCan't cast; pass.\n\
